extends ../baseEmail

block content
  h1 📊 Users Export Ready
  p Hello Admin,
  
  p Your requested users export is ready and attached to this email.
  
  p If you have any issues accessing the file or need assistance, please contact our support team at #{payload.appEmail}.
  
  p
    small Thank you for using our platform!
  small
    b Signed, #{payload.companyName}